OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FThe odd morning shower
OL,6,Fpossible in the far east, otherwise a
OL,7,Fdry and bright day on Saturday with
OL,8,Fspells of sunshine. Temperatures near
OL,9,Faverage.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,12,Fwith sunny spells on Sunday and
OL,13,FMonday, before showers and perhaps
OL,14,Fthunderstorms develop overnight and
OL,15,Finto Tuesday. Feeling warmer,
OL,16,Fparticularly in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
